T*
(- Little: Negative connotation meaning 'almost none': "There was little substrate) Tj
T*
(remaining in the flask" \(Virtually exhausted\).) Tj
T*
(- A Little: Positive connotation meaning 'a small quantity': "A little substrate) Tj
T*
