(- The Little: Refers to the specific small quantity available: "The little) Tj
T*
(substrate that remained was purified.") Tj
T*
(* Each vs. Every: 'Each' emphasizes individual items in a small, distinct group \(two) Tj
T*
(or more\). 'Every' considers all items collectively in a large group. Both take) Tj
T*
(singular verbs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([EXERCISE 1: Phonetic Indefinite Article Assignment]) Tj
T*
(Problem: Insert 'a' or 'an' before each of the following technical terms and acronyms:) Tj
T*
(1. [ ___ ] university campus -> A university \(/j/ glide consonant sound\).) Tj
T*
(2. [ ___ ] honest technician -> AN honest \(silent 'h', initial vowel sound\).) Tj
T*
(3. [ ___ ] unique peptide sequence -> A unique \(/j/ glide consonant sound\).) Tj
T*
(4. [ ___ ] HPLC column -> AN HPLC \(pronounced 'aich-pee-el-see', initial vowel sound) Tj
T*
(/e/\).) Tj
T*
(5. [ ___ ] European standard -> A European \(/j/ glide consonant sound\).) Tj
T*
(6. [ ___ ] RNA transcript -> AN RNA \(pronounced 'ar-en-ay', initial vowel sound /a/\).) Tj
T*
(7. [ ___ ] one-pot synthesis -> A one-pot \(/w/ consonant sound 'won'\).) Tj
T*
(8. [ ___ ] SDS-PAGE gel -> AN SDS-PAGE \(pronounced 'es-dee-es', initial vowel sound) Tj
T*
(/e/\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([EXERCISE 2: Definite Article \(The\) vs. Zero Article Editing]) Tj
T*
(Problem: Insert 'the' where grammatically mandatory, or mark [ZERO] where articles must) Tj
T*
(be omitted:) Tj
T*
(Passage:) Tj
T*
("[1: ___ ] Biotechnology has emerged as [2: ___ ] fastest growing sector in [3: ___ ]) Tj
T*
(modern pharmaceutical industry. In [4: ___ ] recent study conducted at [5: ___ ] Lovely) Tj
T*
(Professional University, researchers extracted [6: ___ ] novel thermostable enzyme from) Tj
T*
([7: ___ ] thermophilic bacterium. [8: ___ ] enzyme retained its catalytic activity at 85) Tj
T*
(deg C.") Tj
T*
(Solution:) Tj
T*
([1] [ZERO]: Academic disciplines take zero article \(Biotechnology\).) Tj
T*
([2] the: Superlative adjectives require 'the' \(the fastest growing\).) Tj
T*
([3] the: Specific defined industry requires 'the' \(the modern pharmaceutical industry\).) Tj
T*
([4] a: Non-specific singular countable noun introduced first time \(a recent study\).) Tj
T*
([5] [ZERO]: Named universities without 'of' take zero article \(Lovely Professional) Tj
T*
(University\).) Tj
T*
([6] a: Non-specific countable noun introduced first time \(a novel thermostable enzyme\).) Tj
T*
([7] a: First mention of bacterium \(a thermophilic bacterium\).) Tj
T*
([8] The: Specific noun previously introduced in sentence 2 \(The enzyme\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([EXERCISE 3: Disambiguating 'Few' vs. 'A Few' and 'Little' vs. 'A Little']) Tj
T*
ET

