(>> 4.5 Key Takeaways and Revision Points) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* 'A' precedes consonant sounds \(including 'university'\); 'An' precedes vowel sounds) Tj
T*
(\(including 'honest', 'NMR'\).) Tj
T*
(* 'The' denotes unique entities, superlatives, and previously introduced specific) Tj
T*
(items; omitted before academic disciplines.) Tj
T*
(* 'Few' and 'Little' carry negative polarity \(almost none\); 'A few' and 'A little') Tj
T*
(carry positive polarity \(some\).) Tj
T*
(* 'Few' applies to countable nouns; 'Little' applies to uncountable nouns.) Tj
T*
